erent shipping terms or special handling.\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"@type\": \"Question\",\n      \"name\": \"How do I start a warranty claim?\",\n      \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n        \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n        \"text\": \"Contact the correct support path with your order details, product information, and a clear description of the issue. Photos or videos can help the team review the issue faster.\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"@type\": \"Question\",\n      \"name\": \"Which address should I visit?\",\n      \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n        \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n        \"text\": \"Public showroom visits and walk-ins should go to 457 Industrial Way, Benicia, CA 94510. Operations, remanufacturing, and outbound shipping are handled through 537 Stone Rd Suite F, which is not open to the public.\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"@type\": \"Question\",\n      \"name\": \"Can I request a video walkthrough?\",\n      \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n        \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n        \"text\": \"Yes. If you are not local to Benicia, you can request a video walkthrough to see equipment remotely, compare options, and ask questions before ordering. Use the Contact page and select Showroom Visit / Video Walkthrough.\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"@type\": \"Question\",\n      \"name\": \"Who founded Fitness Superstore?\",\n      \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n        \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n        \"text\": \"Fitness Superstore was founded by Tim French in 2010.\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"@type\": \"Question\",\n      \"name\": \"Who owns Fitness Superstore?\",\n      \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n        \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n        \"text\": \"Tim French is the founder and owner of Fitness Superstore.\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"@type\": \"Question\",\n      \"name\": \"What is the relationship between Fitness Superstore and French Fitness?\",\n      \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n        \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n        \"text\": \"Fitness Superstore is the retailer, and French Fitness is the new-equipment brand launched in 2019.\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"@type\": \"Question\",\n      \"name\": \"Where is Fitness Superstore based?\",\n      \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n        \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n        \"text\": \"Fitness Superstore is based in Benicia, California. Public showroom visits are at 457 Industrial Way, while operations, remanufacturing, and outbound shipping are handled through 537 Stone Rd Suite F, which is not open to the public.\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"@type\": \"Question\",\n      \"name\": \"Are you hiring?\",\n      \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n        \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n        \"text\": \"Fitness Superstore does not currently list job openings on the website. For general business inquiries, use the Contact page.\"\n      }\n    }\n  ]\n}\n</script>\n\n<script>\ndocument.addEventListener(\"DOMContentLoaded\", function () {\n\n  const faqItems = document.querySelectorAll(\".fs-faq-item\");\n\n  faqItems.forEach(item => {\n\n    item.addEventListener(\"toggle\", function () {\n\n      if (this.open) {\n\n        faqItems.forEach(otherItem => {\n\n          if (otherItem !== this) {\n            otherItem.removeAttribute(\"open\");\n          }\n\n        });\n\n      }\n\n    });\n\n  });\n\n});\n</script>",
